      "content": "Your desire for peace is completely understandable, but it's important to acknowledge these feelings without judgment. Sometimes, those who struggle the most need others who simply listen. Your presence, even in silence, can be profoundly comforting. If you're still open to someone, a few kind words, or just an empathetic ear, could make a world of difference. Finding ways to care for oneself and embracing moments of calm can be immensely powerful. If these feelings become overwhelming, seeking support from a mental health professional might help you find new ways to cope.",
      "source": "target",
